I'll add a utility to detect Firebase permission errors and show a helpful multi-line toast or a long message.

Firebase JS SDK error often has `code: 'permission-denied'` on the error object.

```typescript
function isFirebasePermissionError(e: unknown): boolean {
  if (e && typeof e === "object" && "code" in e) {
    return (e as { code: string }).code === "permission-denied";
  }
  const msg = e instanceof Error ? e.message : String(e);
  return msg.includes("permission") || msg.includes("Permissions");
}
```

